   "widgets_values": [
    "The camera frames @Singer from her head to her waist, slightly from her left, 35mm lens at chest height. The camera slowly orbits from her front-left to her front. The camera never goes behind her; her face always stays in view. @Singer sings the song; her lips follow the vocals and stay closed when there are no vocals. The place is always the @Stage. 0–5s: She sings to the lens with a light groove on the spot, small shoulder bounces. 5–10s: She keeps singing to the lens, one hand loose at her side.\n\nThe camera frames a close-up of @Singer's face and shoulders, 85mm lens, from the very first frame. The camera pushes in very slowly. The camera never goes behind her; her face always stays in view. @Singer sings the song; her lips follow the vocals and stay closed when there are no vocals. The place is always the @Stage. 0–5s: She sings softly to the lens, eyes half closed. 5–10s: She opens her eyes and keeps singing to the lens with a small smile.",
    "Photorealistic music-video look: rich saturated colour, soft bloom around the lights, gentle film grain, realistic skin and fabric texture.",
