   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 44,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "H3 Chain (one click, any length)\n1) Put your song (or dialogue track) into LoadAudio. Put your character sheet, a face close-up and a background image into the three image cards, and describe each one in its text box.\n2) Click the Scene Cuts waveform to place scene changes (empty = every scene_seconds on the State node).\n3) Write one text per scene into State > scenes, separated by blank lines. Call the cards with @Name. Texts repeat if there are more scenes.\n4) Try a short run first: length_mode = seconds, length_seconds = 15. Then set it back to all.\n5) Press Run once. The chain queues itself part by part. Output: ComfyUI/output/H3Chains/<date>_vNN/ (scene_001.mp4 ..., final.mp4, plan.json, scenes.txt).\nRedo scenes: State > redo_session = the session name, redo_scenes = e.g. 2,5; Run; then clear redo_scenes.\nScene text rule: the sentence 'The camera frames ...' must contain no move word; put the move in the next sentence. The '5–10s:' beat must not say 'camera' and should say she sings."
   ]
  },
